    public void AStructuredApplicationIsFormedAfterTheExactSources(string source, string records)
        => Assert.Equal(records, DiagnosticCorpus.RecordProfile(source));

    // SPEC 10.1 (Unknown applicability), 10.1.1, 10.2.1, 10.4 (C-359 B1; DECISIONS D3 with rule W, BU-79; F's ruling 81): an unformed
    // split is an Unknown in one candidate's fit, never a call's verdict by itself. A check that fails through it leaves its part
    // unknown and the trial goes on; the candidate rests on the split (one located Unsupported_Kd at the call) only where every other
    // check passes, and is judged without it otherwise. So SPEC's selection stands where the pair candidate fails a check that reads no
    // unformed Type: `5` or `7` at `string` (ovPK, ovPKs, ovPL), a missing argument (ovPM), a Literal that fits no layer over Box (ovPA,
    // ovPAr, ovPD, ovPj: a Literal meets a pair layer only through its target), a bool that IsSource refuses (ovPB), the reference path
    // alike (ovRf); the single-candidate twins keep NoApplicableOverload_Kd (sK1, sK3-sK7), and a group failing 7.4.1 adds no call
    // record (ovA; ovN, whose pair candidate is inapplicable on IsSource: F's O1 (a)). fce53433a made each of these calls Unsupported_Kd
    // whatever the other candidates. A candidate whose only open check is the split rests on it: selected (ovU1b) or compared as though
    // applicable (ovU2b). A typed argument at a structured application is judged by the common adaptation in each case of the layer
    // (O3, the owner's O-366 (a)): no case adapts a bool at `s/Option<Box>` or an i32 at `s/Option<i32>` (ovS, ovSn; ovSk, ovSkt alone),
    // while a typed `Option<Box>` fits the owner case and rests on the split (ovSo; sK9 with `s is owner or ref`, sK9t its control). A typed Tag at the closed leaf `s/Box` fails it
    // (rT1, rT2 alone), and so does `2.5` at `s/i32` (rT7). One Literal layer rule for a formed and an unformed pattern (the owner's
    // O-372 (a)): a pair layer that formed nothing passes to its target and a ref layer to its referent, while any other layer takes no
    // Literal, so `6` at `s/(uniq/i64 during b)` fails the pair candidate (rT9b accepted as on dev; rT10b alone keeps dev's records).
